\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel central bank \highlight\uc2  cautious on  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 351 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1998\par 18:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Oct 8 (Reuters) - Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jacob Frenkel said on Thursday that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "not the right way" to determine the shekel's exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  He made his comments after mounting speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the shekel broke through what dealers had termed a resistance level of 4.3 against the dollar in trading on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of Israel of course is obligated to defend the borders of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band," Frenkel told Israel Radio from the International Monetary Fund conference in Washington. \par \par \uc2  "But in principle we have worked hard to develop a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that is efficient enough and deep enough to avoid the need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  or other authorities to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily in the fixing of the exchange rate. This (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is not the right way." \par \par \uc2  The shekel, which trades within a sloping trading band whose midpoint is about 15 percent from its edges, is currently trading close to the midpoint. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel attributed the sharp shekel depreciation to corporate activity. \par \par \uc2  "The business sector wants to cover itself...It has foreign-linked debt and now it is buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  not to be exposed to such big changes in the exchange rate," Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  "Things certainly don't appear to be out of control," he said. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the shekel shed 5.0 percent against the dollar for a 10 percent loss since last Friday. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate was fixed at 4.3110 on Thursday compared with 4.0960 on Wednesday. In afternoon trading after the fix, the shekel recouped some of its losses. \par \par \uc2  At 1640 GMT, the shekel was at 4.2412 against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day the dollar sailed through the 4.3 barrier and quickly reached above 4.4 shekels, triggering expectations of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading. "There was no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  whatsoever," a Bank Leumi dealer said. \par \par \uc2  ((Tel Aviv newsroom, +972 3 537-2211 x238, telaviv.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dua801ivs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
