\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli Shares Close -2: Banking Shares See Heavy Selloff \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1998\par 15:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  European stock market declines also fueled the drop in Tel Aviv, brokers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Hapoalim's share price was driven down by investors who had already profited earlier in the year from the bank's share price rise to a high of more than ILS11.00 in June, and are now "ready to sell at any price," one broker said. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, the group of investors led by Carnival Cruise Line owner Ted Arison that bought control of the bank in late 1997 is widely believed to be buying heavily more shares. \par \par \uc2  Teva Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd. shares bucked the market trend, posting a 0.9% gain to ILS151.60 from ILS150.60 on a volume of ILS17.3 million. Brokers had no special explanation for the rise. \par \par \uc2  Israeli legislators and economic leaders called on Bank of Israel Governor Jacob Frenkel Thursday to return from an International Monetary Fund meeting in the U.S. to calm the market. \par \par \uc2  Brokers and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said they expect to see the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading within the next few days, selling dollars to stem the tide of purchases. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has more than $21 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As for a possible rise to the 9.5% discount rate, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par will probably wait until the scheduled announcement date of Oct. 26\par rather than declare it early "because that could be another reason for\par panic," said one broker.\par    -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-10-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1359GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  5074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920dua8004pe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
