\par\par \b \uc2  Israel/Shekel -3: Volumes Relatively Large For Holiday Week \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1998\par 13:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Volumes were relatively large considering the market's low liquidity during an abbreviated holiday week and trading was frenzied, dealers said. The low liquidity has heightened the influence of individual transactions on the exchange rate. Most of the transactions were interbank, the dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Foreigners were in buying, locals were in buying in a panic-stricken market," said one dealing room manager in Tel Aviv. "At some point the market hit ILS4.4700, but now they're selling (dollars) a bit," he said. \par \par \uc2  At 1113 GMT, the shekel was trading around ILS4.3200 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Given the current pace of depreciation, the shekel could fall as low as ILS4.7500 to the dollar within the next few days, the dealing room manager said, estimating that may be the point where the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But even if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  begins selling dollars to support the shekel, it will be in relatively low volumes "because as soon as they come in in size, they'll be adding liquidity to the market" which in this case may just add fuel to the fire, he said. \par \par \uc2  Chaim Fromowitz, head of trading at Bank Leumi, said that if it occurred, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would calm the market because it "would send a signal...that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a level beyond which it won't let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devalue in such a short period of time." \par \par \uc2  The shekel is allowed to trade within a range of 15% on either side of a gradually depreciating midpoint. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel is committed officially to defending the upper and lower limits of that band. But the shekel's descent to within 11% of the lower boundary from 20% in only a few days may force the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make a move, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1138GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920dua8004iv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
