\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Israeli shekel slides, rates seen rising. \b0\par\par\uc2 396 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 1998\par 13:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Oct 6 (Reuters) - The Israeli shekel suffered a second session of steep losses on Tuesday, weakening two percent to a fix of 4.011 against the dollar and prompting speculation about an interest rate rise, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they were not sure at what level the shekel would stabilise. \par \par \uc2  "We have reached a point where resistance and support are not applicable," said a dealer at Bank Leumi, adding he expected the Bank of Israel to raise interest rates in response. \par \par \uc2  In the early afternoon after the fix, the shekel was trading above 4.07 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at Bank Hapoalim attributed the drop to general market uncertainty and falls on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange. The Tel Aviv-100 index was down 4.6 percent in afternoon trading. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has shed some 3.6 percent since Friday, capping an 8.9 percent slide in the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since August, when the Bank of Israel slashed the base lending rate by 1.5 percentage points and global markets began to tumble. \par \par \uc2  The Bank Leumi dealer said he did not expect the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  "They're going to raise interest rates since \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  would go against the prescribed medicine," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is committed to keeping the shekel within a trading band set against the basket rate, but the range is a wide 30.88 percent on both sides of a sloping mid-point. Even with its recent losses the shekel is nearly 20 percent away from the weak edge of the band. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said he expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise the November base lending rate by one point. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 4.0110 shekels, against 3.9310 on Friday, the last day of trading before the Sukkoth holiday. \par \par \uc2  The basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 4.3924 shekels against 4.3128 shekels on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded at 3.0190 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.9364 shekels on Friday, and against the mark at 2.4501 shekels compared with 2.4091 shekels on Friday. \par \par \uc2  ((Tel Aviv newsroom, +9723 537-2211 x238, telaviv.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dua601c6x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
