\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Israel Offcial: No Promises To Avert Shekel Drop \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 13:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading to moderate a sharp depreciation of the shekel if there's a speculative attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department said in a speech. \par \par \uc2  There have been concerns that the shekel could be open to speculative attack and may weaken considerably once it is declared fully convertible around May 1, the date of Israel's 50th jubilee. Many restrictions on the shekel have already been lifted in a process that began in 1985 and gathered steam in 1997 and early 1998. \par \par \uc2  In a copy of a speech received Monday by Dow Jones Newswires, the director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department, Sylvia Piterman, said: 'The Bank of Israel obviously doesn't pledge to wait until the shekel reaches the weakest point in its band before entering the market, but that possibility should be taken into account.' \par \par \uc2  The shekel is adjusted daily against a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  dominated by the dollar, weighted at 60%, and including the British pound, the Deutsche mark, the French franc and the Japanese yen. It is allowed to fluctuate 15% either side of its midpoint. \par \par \uc2  'Even if the Bank of Israel is committed to defending the trading band, the bank doesn't currently have any nominal exchange rate targets within the band,' Piterman told a conference Sunday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 09-03-98 \par \par \uc2  1234GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du390220s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
