\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Unchanged Vs Dlr in Moderate Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1998\par 16:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The shekel (ILS) traded unchanged against the dollar late Thursday, but foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said an expected rush of dollar sales could force Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  next week. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the shekel at ILS3.5860 to the dollar, unchanged from Wednesday's fixing. Trading was evenly divided between dollar purchases and sales amid moderate volumes, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has strengthened 0.5% since the United Nations and Iraq signed a weapons inspection agreement Monday, and on Thursday was just half a percent off the strongest point in its trading band. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at United Mizrahi Bank said routine dollar sales at the end of the month to pay March 1 salaries could strengthen the shekel even further and force the Bank of Israel to buy dollars to weaken the shekel and keep it within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last entered trading in late December and early January, buying hundreds of millions of dollars in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the shekel and defend the trading band. \par \par \uc2  The band allows a fluctuation of 15% from either side of a gradually depreciating midpoint. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The shekel traded within a range of ILS3.5810 to ILS3.5880 to the\par dollar Thursday. Shortly after the 1330 GMT fixing, the shekel was\par trading at ILS3.5850.\par -By Michele Gershberg; 972-2-537-6985; mgershberg@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1506GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2q01qha\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
