\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel strengthens sharply vs dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 317 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Jan 21 (Reuters) - The shekel representative rate strengthened sharply against the dollar and the basket in active trading on Wednesday, bringing the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  close to the point where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at United Mizrahi Bank attributed much of the shekel's gains to the fact that one company took out a large loan in dollars, which it converted into shekels. \par \par \uc2  "One large entity took out a big loan, about $100 million, and then converted it to shekels, causing a strengthening of the shekel," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  After losing a great deal of ground to the dollar on Friday, the shekel picked up, bringing it closer to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a dealer from \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Discount Bank said. \par \par \uc2  "We're about 0.5 percent away from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said the dealer. On Tuesday, the shekel's rate against the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to which it is pegged was at 1.05 percent away from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Earlier this month the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times to prevent the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from appreciating beyond its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The Discount dealer said he expects to see some volatility before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces February interest rates on January 26. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to lower rates slightly. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.5820 shekels against 3.6050 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.8143 against 3.8347 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.8056 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7910 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9564 shekels compared with 1.9606 on Tuesday. ((Tel Aviv newsroom, +972 3 537-2211 x238, telaviv.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du1l03wgu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
