\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Bank of Israel buys $20 mln in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Jan 8 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prevent the shekel from appreciating beyond its trading band, but this time bought less than $20 million, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "It's the same story again. The basket remained on the lower edge and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, buying less then $20 million," said \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Sapir of Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is pegged to a basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The basket rate hovered at the lower limit, the shekel's strong side, of the trading band throughout Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began buying dollars in the local market starting last Wednesday, marking its first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last June, when foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reform and a sharp interest rate cut temporarily weakened the shekel. \par \par \uc2  "Volume was moderate and the shekel was stable during the day," Sapir added. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.5650 shekels against 3.5640 on Wednesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.7894 against 3.7898 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.6746 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.6913 on Wednesday, and against the mark at 1.9516 shekels compared with 1.9506 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.5630 shekels. \par \par \uc2  ((Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, +972 3 537-2211 x238, telaviv.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926du18019l7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
