ighlight\uc2 \f2  Basket Vs Shekel in Dec 1997\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par high 3.8111 shekels\par low  3.7815 shekels\par -0.7% change in month (nominal)\par +4.2% change year-to-date (nominal, annualized)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 01-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2239GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1100094\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
