\par\par \b \uc2  Israel  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -3: Steady, High Discount Rate Cuts Risk \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Dezember 1997\par 19:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  But since the trading band was changed, 'the market has been very quiet, with relatively low volumes and low volatility, without a growth in credit-taking and until yesterday, without \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Viskin said. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought between $50 million and $70 million to weaken the shekel and defend the trading band, dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought more than $170 million during trading Wednesday, dealers estimated. They wouldn't predict how long the renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might last. \par \par \uc2  They maintain that since the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  brought the discount rate back up to 13.4% in September to counter inflationary pressures, customers have resumed loan-taking in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but at a slower rate. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the Bank of Israel reported that foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans grew a net $4.8 billion in the first half of 1997, but rose by a relatively lower amount - $700 million - between July and November. \par \par \uc2  Year-end financing needs and the expiry of dollar-shekel options gave the market a final push above the ceiling of the band at the end of December, with customers selling dollars and strengthening the shekel. \par \par \uc2  Chaim Fromowitz, trading manager at No.2 Bank Leumi, said the year-end factors might have been a heavy but temporary influence on the market that 'goes away after today.' \par \par \uc2  'So it's going to be a new game beginning Friday,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts expect the Bank of Israel will lower the discount rate in the first quarter of 1998 by as much as 100 basis points. \par \par \uc2  This move alone may stem the shekel's strength, making loan-taking in a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  less attractive because of a narrower differential between interest rates. \par \par \uc2  -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 31-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1806GMT \par \par \uc2  1145 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcv0a1h6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
