\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: 1997 Ends With  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Dezember 1997\par 19:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Otherwise, the market could get stuck in a now familiar stalemate. \par \par \uc2  Israel's high discount rate over the past three years made borrowing in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  an attractive practice for customers who benefited from the interest rate differentials. \par \par \uc2  The conversion of these foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  into shekels repeatedly strengthened the shekel beyond government-approved limits, forcing the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading. A low-risk balance was created, in which customers could reasonably predict at what price the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The run for speculative 'hot money' forced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy $7 billion in the first 5 1/2 months of 1997, and spurred the year's most noteworthy event on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market: the widening of the shekel's trading band on June 18. \par \par \uc2  That move, which slowed the rate of the shekel's depreciation, led Finance Minister Dan Meridor to quit, put a brake on speculative loan-taking in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and generated the first net capital outflow from Israel since the end of 1993. \par \par \uc2  The same day the government changed the trading band parameters, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  slashed the discount rate 120 basis points to 12.7% from 13.9%. \par \par \uc2  'This year was divided into two parts,' said Bank Hapoalim's Viskin. 'Until June the shekel stayed close to its strongest point' in the trading band, with Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  a dominant, and near-daily feature of trading, he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 31-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1803GMT \par \par \uc2  1145 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcv0a1h4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
