\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Bank of Israel buys $70 mln in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 386 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Dec 30 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading on Tuesday for the first time since June, buying an estimated $70 million to support the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading today by buying dollars to support the basket," said a dealer at the First International Bank of Israel. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stayed out of the market since mid-June, when \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reforms and a big cut in interest rates set off a sharp depreciation of the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Since then the shekel has recouped most of its losses against the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to which it is pegged. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday the Bank of Israel had to buy dollars after the basket's exchange rate reached the lower limit (the shekel's strong side) of its trading band. \par \par \uc2  Olivier Hakoune of Union Bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  just before the setting of the representative rate. "The basket was traded most of the day below the lower limit, and investors were waiting for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  He said trading was heavy because the business sector was converting foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for end-of-the-year payments and because Maof dollar options for December expired on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted that the market was also affected by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement on Monday that it was keeping its key lending rate unchanged at 13.4 percent for January. The rate has been at that level since the end of August. \par \par \uc2  The FIBI dealer said the exchange rates were expected to remain in the near term at their current levels. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.5340 shekels against 3.5270 on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.7857 against 3.7898 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7282 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7133 on Monday, and against the mark at 1.9718 shekels compared with 1.9856 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.5320 shekels. \par \par \uc2  ((Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, +972 3 537-2211 x238) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtcu00krj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
