\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Up Vs Dlr: No Discount Rate Change Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1997\par 15:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The shekel skimmed the strongest point in its trading band Monday, as a wave of dollar sales pushed it higher against foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and raised expectations the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the shekel at 3.5270 to the dollar, 0.2% stronger than Wednesday's fixing of 3.5340 to the dollar. There were no fixings over the Christmas period. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded between 3.5230 and 3.5340 to the dollar. Shortly after the 1330 GMT fixing, the shekel was trading at 3.5260. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said trading opened with the shekel at 3.53 to the dollar. Customers bought dollars early in the session, but a rush of dollar sales at midday strengthened the shekel to around 3.52 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  At that point, the shekel was trading 0.1% from the strongest point in its trading band. Trading was active, on low to moderate volumes. \par \par \uc2  One dealer at United Mizrahi Bank said companies were selling dollars to pay Jan. 1 wages, a regular influence on the market at the end of each month. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said some of the dollar sales were speculative, in advance of the release of the January discount rate at 1430GMT. \par \par \uc2  Analysts don't expect a change in the discount rate, predicting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will wait to see whether parliament passes the 1998 state budget and a 2.3-billion-shekel package of budget cuts this week. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 29-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1416GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtct09z78\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
