\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  Shekel Up Vs Dlr:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\uc2  Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 316 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Dezember 1997\par 15:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel was stronger against the dollar in late trading Wednesday, grazing the strongest point in its trading band and raising expectations the Bank of Israel will be forced to buy dollars to weaken it. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since it widened the trading band June 18. The Bank of Israel had bought $7 billion in the first five and a half months of the year to defend the old band. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixed the shekel at 3.5330 to the dollar, a strengthening of 0.03% from Tuesday's fixing of 3.5340 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded within a range of 3.5300 to 3.5380 to the dollar. Shortly after the 1330 GMT fixing, the shekel was trading at 3.5350 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Trading volumes were light to moderate, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. One dealer said he had expected to see \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, or in the very near future. \par \par \uc2  'It's really close' (to the upper end of the band), said Allen Langner, a dealer at Eurotrust Ltd. \par \par \uc2  Langner attributed the shekel's strengthening to renewed market confidence the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't depreciate sharply. Before the trading band was widened, customers would take out loans in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and benefit from Israel's high discount rate - now 13.4% - when they cashed the loans in for shekels. \par \par \uc2  But the shekel's immediate devaluation after the trading band was changed raised the risk of loan-taking. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The shekel's rapid recovery, however, has caused sentiments to turn,\par Langner said. 'It looks like the market has seen enough. There's a major\par renewal of borrowing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  here.'\par -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1435GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtca09hci\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
