\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel higher against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Dec 9 (Reuters) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate on Tuesday was fixed higher against the dollar and the basket and dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  "On Monday the shekel fell sharply but it started recovering in late (Monday) trading after the setting of the representative rate," said Zahi Elias of Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  He said that on Tuesday volume was low and the shekel remained stable. \par \par \uc2  Elias added that the basket rate traded on Tuesday at only 0.2 percent above the lower limit (the shekel's strong side) of the trading band. If the shekel reaches the limit the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the shekel from strengthening beyond the band. \par \par \uc2  Elias said that if the dollar continues to rise against the yen and mark abroad the basket will decline and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stayed out of the market since mid-June, when the twin announcements of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reforms and a 1.2 percentage point cut in interest rates set off a sharp depreciation of the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.5340 shekels against 3.5430 on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.7846 against 3.7946 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7127 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7102 on Monday, and against the mark at 1.9766 shekels compared with 1.9803 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.5330 shekels. \par \par \uc2  ((Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, +972 3 537-2211 x238, telaviv.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc9019c1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
