\par\par \b \uc2  Israel/Leon-2: Pleased With Trading Band Change \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 1997\par 14:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Frenkel had been cutting the discount rate from August 1996, then raised it by 70 basis points in September to its current level of 13.4%. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel maintains that he must pursue a tight monetary policy to tame inflation. \par \par \uc2  Leon stressed the government doesn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy, the report said. \par \par \uc2  He praised the widening of the shekel band on June 18. The new band increased the level of risk in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, thus deterring customers from taking loans in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and converting them into shekels, and reducing speculation, he was quoted as saying. \par \par \uc2  'It's a fact that capital inflows turned into capital outflows,' Leon was quoted as saying. 'Market forces played out on their own without Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported net capital outflows by Israelis in the third quarter of the year, for the first time in four years. Inflows had been the norm because customers had been taking advantage of the gap between the high interest rate in Israel and the interest on major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on worldwide markets. \par \par \uc2  From January through mid-June, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to weaken the shekel, buying some $7 billion this year before changing the shekel's trading band on June 18. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1208GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtal07x5e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
