\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel -4: Strengthened By Capital Inflows \b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 1997\par 16:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Yet even if the loan-taking boom has ended, Katznelson said, large capital inflows from other sources are still strengthening the shekel. \par \par \uc2  Capital inflows from foreign investments grew to $1.04 billion in the third quarter of 1997, compared to $435 million in the second quarter, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel might have prevented some of the inflow by imposing taxes on capital imports or on foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans, 'but now it's too late,' Katznelson said. \par \par \uc2  And given the current political climate, and rising unemployment, Frenkel won't widen the trading band further, leaving the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  no choice but to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said. \par \par \uc2  The head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department, Sylvia Piterman, recently said it wasn't likely that the trading band would be changed again because of the shekel's strengthening. \par \par \uc2  Piterman maintained that with the readjustment of the ceiling's slope, a much more moderate depreciation rate will enable the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to achieve the government's 1997-98 inflation target of 7% to 10%. \par \par \uc2  That will permit the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to loosen its monetary policy, and that will weaken the shekel a bit and move it away from the ceiling of the band, she said. \par \par \uc2  She said it was 'very difficult' to assess whether large-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be likely again. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1413GMT \par \par \uc2  1147 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtad07rqo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
