\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel flat against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Sept 3 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel was fixed almost unchanged against the dollar on Wednesday in trendless trade, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was trendless and the shekel remained almost unchanged. Volume was also low and the market is very quiet," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The basket was traded at 0.35 percent above the lower limit (or strong side) of the trading band. I believe that in the future the basket will reach the lower limit and the bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since June, when \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reform and a 1.2 percentage point cut in interest rates set off a sharp depreciation of the shekel. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not expected to lower interest rates from an annualised 13.4 percent before the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  "Since the rate is relatively high, investors will prefer to take foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -linked loans, which will lead to another strengthening of the shekel," he said. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.5150 shekels, compared with 3.5160 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.7493 against 3.7508 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.8990 shekels per 100 yen, compared with 2.8901 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9306 shekels, compared with 1.9299 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.5150 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 x238 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt9300co6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
