\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Weaker Against Dollar Late In Day \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1997\par 16:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel is weaker against the dollar late Tuesday, and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers attributed the decline to stronger dollar buying during the day by customers wary of a stengthening shekel. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixed the shekel at 3.5160 to the dollar, a weakening of 0.11% against Monday's close of 3.5120 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded within a range of 3.5110 to 3.5210 to the dollar. Shortly after the 1230 GMT fixing, the shekel was trading at 3.5140. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the shekel had strengthened 0.73% against the dollar in the month of August alone and that it was probing the strongest point in its trading band. \par \par \uc2  Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers expect the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in trading to weaken the shekel, generally by buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market since the shekel's trading band was changed in mid-June. \par \par \uc2  Elad Shraga, a dealer with Israel Discount Bank, said the market opened with dominant dollar buys and was characterized by interbank trading. \par \par \uc2  'We saw people were scared the shekel will get attached again' to the strongest point in its trading band, Shraga said. \par \par \uc2  He said the market wasn't responding to the rise in the country's discount rate - to 13.4% from 12.7% - by taking out loans in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In the past, customers would take out credit in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to benefit from the discount rate differentials when they converted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into shekels. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1417GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9206jm0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
