\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Up Against Dollar In Quiet Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 September 1997\par 15:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel traded up against the dollar in quiet, late trading Monday amid conversions from dollars to shekels in the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixed the shekel at 3.5120 to the dollar, a strengthening of 0.6% against Friday's close of 3.5140 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded within a range of 3.5170 to 3.5075 to the dollar. Shortly after the 1230 GMT fixing, the shekel was trading at 3.5130. \par \par \uc2  Gideon Sadeh, a dealer with Bank Leumi, said trading was quiet on low volumes. He said the dominance of conversions from dollars into shekels brought the shekel up. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said the conversions reflected the remnants of transactions common at the end of the month when customers need shekels to pay salaries. \par \par \uc2  She said the shekel was approaching the strongest point in its trading band, reversing the depreciation it experienced after the band was changed on June 18. \par \par \uc2  In August the shekel appreciated 0.73% against the dollar, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose 1.6% in August to $18.3 billion, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said reserves have increased at a slower rate since June because the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to weaken the shekel. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1346GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9106kuw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
