\par\par \b \uc2  Shekel/ \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -2: Supported By Rate Differentials \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 1997\par 13:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The day the government voted to widen the trading band, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut the discount rate 1.2 percentage points. \par \par \uc2  Advocates of a rate cut hoped such a move would dampen the shekel's appeal to investors, who have taken advantage of interest-rate differentials to borrow in low-rate foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and convert the funds into shekels, increasing demand for the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Within days of the band's widening, the shekel traded 5% below its strongest point within the band. Now it's 2% below the band's ceiling. \par \par \uc2  Once the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaches the ceiling, 'There are some that would expect the Bank of Israel to get involved,' a high-ranking dealer at a Tel Aviv bank said, after which it 'would just stay there for a while.' \par \par \uc2  If the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  weren't to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , 'then all bets are off,' the dealer said. 'It would be uncharted waters then, and one could guess anything they want.' \par \par \uc2  A Bank of Israel spokesman said Monday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to defend the shekel's trading band as it has in the past. \par \par \uc2  'We are committed to the exchange rate, and there has been no change in that commitment,' the spokesman said. \par \par \uc2  'And who's to say the shekel won't weaken again?' asked one \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  source. \par \par \uc2  Under the new exchange-rate parameters, the shekel's trading band will widen over the next 11 months to 15% on either side of a yet-undetermined midpoint. The band's old parameters permitted a fluctuation of 7% on either side of a midpoint that depreciated 6% annually. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1107GMT \par \par \uc2  1142 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7l05bf7\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (israel near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\r